        "answer": {
          "short": "400 Robux: 2.12 cents per Robux; 1,700 Robux: 2.06 cents per Robux; 22,500 Robux: 1.64 cents per Robux. The best buy is 22,500 Robux for \\$369.99.",
          "worked": "400 Robux for \\$8.49:\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cost per Robux}&=\\frac{849}{400}\\text{ cents}\\\\\\text{Cost per Robux}&=2.1225\\text{ cents}\\\\\\text{Cost per Robux}&\\approx2.12\\text{ cents}\\end{aligned}$$\n1,700 Robux for \\$34.99:\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cost per Robux}&=\\frac{3499}{1700}\\text{ cents}\\\\\\text{Cost per Robux}&\\approx2.06\\text{ cents}\\end{aligned}$$\n22,500 Robux for \\$369.99:\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cost per Robux}&=\\frac{36999}{22500}\\text{ cents}\\\\\\text{Cost per Robux}&\\approx1.64\\text{ cents}\\end{aligned}$$\nThe 22,500-Robux package has the lowest cost per Robux, so 22,500 Robux for \\$369.99 is the best buy.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44,
        "responseSpace": "scaffold"
      },
